The behaviour of the initialization script has changed:

* Use ``-b`` to pass a custom branch name instead of passing it as the first argument
* The first positional argument now allows to select from one of the available templates (currently ``minimal``,``openstack``,``proxmox``)

See :ref:`Initialization (OpenStack) <quick-start.openstack.create-and-initialize-cluster-repository>` and :ref:`Initialization (Proxmox) <quick-start.proxmox.create-and-initialize-cluster-repository>`
